<title>RUSSIA: Russian October inflation 1.2 pct vs 0.3 pct.</title>
<headline>Russian October inflation 1.2 pct vs 0.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia's monthly consumer price inflation accelerated in October to 1.2 percent, the State Statistics Committee said on Thursday.</p>
<p>    RUSSIAN CONSUMER PRICES    OCT 96    SEP 96    OCT 95</p>
<p>    Month-on-month change	 +1.2	+0.3	+4.7</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change	    N/A     +31.7    +187</p>
<p>If current price trends continue, inflation over the whole of 1996, as measured by the year-on-year rate in December, will be 21.0 percent, the committee said.</p>
<p>Inflation in the week ended October 28 was 0.2 percent, the same as in the previous week, it said.</p>
<p>    RUSSIAN CONSUMER PRICES    w/e Oct 28	   w/e Oct 21</p>
<p>    Week-on-week change		+0.2		   +0.2</p>
<p>					   Oct 1-28	    Sept 1-30</p>
<p>    Average daily inflation	  +0.038		 +0.011</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
